export anchor DenseDealTableStyle:
    number: 337
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Dense deal table
    idea: The whole pipeline as one tight 13px table grouped by stage, with group subtotals, a sorted value column, small bracketed status tags and the summary squeezed into a single line of key figures.
    base: dark
    palette:
        base: #111418, the page, table body and style sheet
        head: #1a1f26, the header row, summary line, footer and secondary buttons
        zebra: #151a20, even rows
        group: #1d232b, stage group rows
        line: #262d36, every rule and border
        ink: #e3e7ec, text
        muted: #9aa4b1, column heads, dates and counts
        orange: #ff9e64, the sort arrow, percent, primary button and focus
        red: #ff8a80, the STALLED tag, its row edge and triangle
        sky: #7fd4ff, the DEMO and CLOSING tags
        lilac: #cdb6ff, the SENT tag
        green: #8be39b, the WON tag with a check
    type:
        system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Arial, with figures and tags in
        ui-monospace, Cascadia Mono, Menlo, Consolas. Base 13px at 1.4. The
        title is 15px at 650, cells 13px, values 13px mono with tabular
        numbers, column heads 11px uppercase at 600, tags 11px mono at 600.
    layout:
        A small breadcrumb Brightwork, Sales, Pipeline Q4 sits over the
        title Deal pipeline. One bordered mono line lists pipeline 412,000,
        won 128,500 of 200,000 with 64 percent in orange, target, win rate
        31 percent and open 18, split by thin rules. A toolbar holds a
        filter field, Group Stage and Owner All buttons, then Columns and
        an orange Deal button. The table has columns Deal, Owner, Value,
        Status and Date, with Value sorted high to low and an orange down
        arrow. Group rows per stage show a down chevron, the stage, a mono
        count and a right aligned subtotal. Rows are 30px and zebra striped,
        owners carry a boxed mono initials tag, statuses are bracketed mono
        tags with an icon, and the stalled row has a 3px red inset edge. A
        footer row sums the seven shown deals. A 280px Activity panel sits
        right with three ruled rows. Below 980px the panel drops below,
        on phones the table scrolls inside its frame with the deal column
        pinned.
    spacing: A 4px unit. 30px rows, 28px group rows and controls, 10px cell padding, 20px gutter, 16px on phones.
    density: High. Every deal, subtotal and the activity log fit on one screen.
    corners: 3px on the table frame, fields and buttons, square cells.
    borders: 1px #262d36 under every row, round the table and between summary figures.
    shadows: None. A 3px red inset edge marks the stalled row.
    icons:
        14px line icons at 1.9 stroke. Tags sit in square brackets with a
        triangle, calendar, flag, paper plane or check beside the word.
    focus: A 2px orange outline drawn inside the control.
    tone: Terse and technical, with lowercase key figures, Group Stage, Owner All and Columns.
